WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Planetary 15s v1.0 — time-as-an-index (yo) · elevenlabs:eleven_v4_turbo

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:10.364
<v Narrator>Ni akọkọ, ni inu akoko lilọ ti mathematiki, gbogbo awọn isẹpo dijital yoo bajẹ ni akoko kan nikan pẹlu paadi alailẹgbẹ igba-ọkan.

2
00:00:10.444 --> 00:00:18.686
<v Narrator>Ninu fiimu, ko si awọn ohun ti o ni ibatan pẹlu awọn ẹtan, awọn aṣiṣe tabi awọn ọran ti o le ṣe akiyesi.

3
00:00:18.766 --> 00:00:29.090
<v Narrator>Oju-iwe ayelujara ti o wa nibẹ jẹ oju opo wẹẹbu kan ti a ṣe apẹrẹ lati pese awọn iṣẹ ṣiṣe ti o rọrun ati irọrun fun gbogbo eniyan.
